<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a98b5f;">お問い合わせ受付完了</div>
<h1 class="email-title" style="margin:8px 0 14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman','Yu Mincho',serif;font-size:32px;line-height:42px;font-weight:400;color:#26221b;">お問い合わせありがとうございます</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 26px;font-family:Arial,'Yu Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:26px;color:#655e54;">{{ full_name | html.escape }} 様、メッセージを受け付けました。{{ company_name }} のスタッフが内容を確認し、できるだけ早くご返信いたします。</p>
<div style="padding:20px 22px;background-color:#26221b;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;">
  <div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#c9ae83;">お問い合わせ番号</div>
  <div style="padding-top:5px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#ffffff;">{{ reference_code | html.escape }}</div>
</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%;margin-top:22px;border-collapse:separate;background-color:#faf7f1;border:1px solid #e9e0d2;border-radius:12px;">
  <tr><td class="detail-label" style="width:34%;padding:18px 10px 8px 22px;font-family:Arial,'Yu Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7c7468;">件名</td><td style="padding:18px 22px 8px 10px;font-family:Arial,'Yu Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#26221b;">{{ subject | html.escape }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 10px 18px 22px;font-family:Arial,'Yu Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7c7468;">返信先メール</td><td style="padding:8px 22px 18px 10px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#26221b;">{{ email | html.escape }}</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-family:Arial,'Yu Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:22px;color:#7c7468;">お急ぎの場合は <a href="tel:{{ company_phone }}" style="font-weight:bold;color:#8a6e48;text-decoration:none;">{{ company_phone }}</a> までお電話いただくか、このメールに直接ご返信ください。</p>
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:28px auto 0;"><tr><td style="border-radius:6px;background-color:#a98b5f;"><a href="{{ website_url }}/ja" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 26px;font-family:Arial,'Yu Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">BB Homes へ戻る&nbsp; →</a></td></tr></table>
